      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: UnityEditor.GraphToolkitModule}
      data:
        m_Value: 'Pirate Hideout, a bar mission: pirates hide 8 km out from the station where the squad took the job.

          The squad launches, follows the waypoint and destroys them; the reward is split across the squad.

          15 minutes, else it fails; so does the squad leaving the pirates'' orbit.'
